[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1020.629, "timestamp": "00:17:00", "text": "等等，我猜C网站上有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1022.629, "timestamp": "00:17:02", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1028.15, "timestamp": "00:17:08", "text": "如果我没记错的话，汽车网站已经添加了，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1031.59, "timestamp": "00:17:11", "text": "是的，历史是新的。历史是崭新的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1034.069, "timestamp": "00:17:14", "text": "是的。是的，他们添加了一个时间线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1035.99, "timestamp": "00:17:15", "text": "我当时就想，“哇，这是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1038.949, "timestamp": "00:17:18", "text": "不错。” 我也应该……嗯，就像我想的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1041.909, "timestamp": "00:17:21", "text": "就像是“是啊”。呃，它会加载所有内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1044.87, "timestamp": "00:17:24", "text": "您可以将其筛选为特定选项。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1048.71, "timestamp": "00:17:28", "text": "出色地。我们做了咳嗽在2028年做的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1053.029, "timestamp": "00:17:33", "text": "2024年。这种很酷。不，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1054.95, "timestamp": "00:17:34", "text": "做类似这样的事情。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1057.59, "timestamp": "00:17:37", "text": "想做类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1060.39, "timestamp": "00:17:40", "text": "这样我就可以像展示一样展示自己了。但这只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1062.63, "timestamp": "00:17:42", "text": "适用于音乐会等正式活动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1064.39, "timestamp": "00:17:44", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1066.87, "timestamp": "00:17:46", "text": "什么？什么？我为什么要堵塞这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1069.75, "timestamp": "00:17:49", "text": "历史之类的东西，比如溪流和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1071.59, "timestamp": "00:17:51", "text": "像什么东西？东西太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1073.35, "timestamp": "00:17:53", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1077.35, "timestamp": "00:17:57", "text": "然后还有这位 IRL 主播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1079.43, "timestamp": "00:17:59", "text": "被称为联盟。"}]